WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Customer: My order confirmation arrived, but I can’t find the tracking link.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Agent: Do you see an order number in the email? I want to confirm that the missing item is the tracking link, not the confirmation itself.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Customer: Yes, the order number is SYNTH-104. The confirmation is fine.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Agent: Please open the order page and select “Delivery details”. If a tracking link has been assigned, it will appear there. If it is still missing, reply to this support conversation and we can check the delivery status.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Customer: I see the link now. That answers my question, thank you.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Agent: You’re welcome. Let us know here if you need another check.
